{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"查理·芒格·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"charlie-munger","categoryLabel":"查理·芒格","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/04_charlie-munger/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>本卷盘点查理·芒格留给世人的&quot;代表成就&quot;——不是抽象的思想原理，而是承载这些原理的<strong>具体作品与可核验的实业成果</strong>：一部经典著作、若干传世讲演、一段缔造商业传奇的投资生涯。芒格一生几乎不写书，他把表达交给讲演、问答与致股东信，因此他的&quot;代表作&quot;形态独特：既有汇编成册的《穷查理宝典》，也有以投资回报为载体的伯克希尔成就。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>这是理解本卷定位的关键。同一主题（如误判心理学、能力圈）会在多个卷出现，但视角不同，请按需取用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本卷·代表成就</strong></td>\n<td>芒格留下了<strong>哪些作品和成果</strong>？</td>\n<td>载体与证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>芒格提出了<strong>什么原理</strong>（多元思维、能力圈、逆向）？</td>\n<td>本卷作品所承载的思想</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想方法</a></td>\n<td>这些原理<strong>如何运作</strong>（25 种偏误、叠加效应）？</td>\n<td>本卷讲演内容的体系化拆解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>芒格的<strong>人生轨迹</strong>如何？</td>\n<td>本卷成就的人物史背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些成就<strong>影响了谁</strong>？</td>\n<td>本卷成果的后续涟漪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：本卷讲&quot;<strong>做出了什么</strong>&quot;，核心贡献与思想方法讲&quot;<strong>想的是什么、怎么想</strong>&quot;，影响与遗产讲&quot;<strong>改变了什么</strong>&quot;。因此本卷在涉及具体原理时一律交叉链接到对应卷，不重复展开论证——同一事实只在主篇深讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构\">本卷结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ROOT[&quot;代表成就&quot;]&#10;  ROOT --&gt; C1[&quot;第一章 穷查理宝典&lt;br/&gt;(著述)&quot;]&#10;  ROOT --&gt; C2[&quot;第二章 伯克希尔与投资成就&lt;br/&gt;(实业)&quot;]&#10;  ROOT --&gt; C3[&quot;第三章 演讲与教诲&lt;br/&gt;(传道)&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C1A[&quot;这部书及其智慧&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C1B[&quot;十一篇讲演&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C2A[&quot;伯克希尔的成功&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C2B[&quot;经典投资案例&quot;]&#10;  C3 --&gt; C3A[&quot;误判心理学演讲&quot;]&#10;  C3 --&gt; C3B[&quot;南加大毕业演讲&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  ROOT[\"代表成就\"]\n  ROOT --&gt; C1[\"第一章 穷查理宝典&lt;br/&gt;(著述)\"]\n  ROOT --&gt; C2[\"第二章 伯克希尔与投资成就&lt;br/&gt;(实业)\"]\n  ROOT --&gt; C3[\"第三章 演讲与教诲&lt;br/&gt;(传道)\"]\n  C1 --&gt; C1A[\"这部书及其智慧\"]\n  C1 --&gt; C1B[\"十一篇讲演\"]\n  C2 --&gt; C2A[\"伯克希尔的成功\"]\n  C2 --&gt; C2B[\"经典投资案例\"]\n  C3 --&gt; C3A[\"误判心理学演讲\"]\n  C3 --&gt; C3B[\"南加大毕业演讲\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 <a href=\"poor-charlies-almanack/\">穷查理宝典</a></strong>——这部 2005 年由彼得·考夫曼编辑、2023 年由 Stripe Press 重版的合集，是芒格思想最完整的容器；其思想主干是被编号 Talk One–Eleven 的十一篇讲演。<ul>\n<li><a href=\"poor-charlies-almanack/the-book-and-its-wisdom\">这部书及其智慧</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"poor-charlies-almanack/the-eleven-talks\">十一篇讲演</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 <a href=\"berkshire-investments/\">伯克希尔与投资成就</a></strong>——把抽象理念变成可核验数字的实业证据。<ul>\n<li><a href=\"berkshire-investments/the-berkshire-success\">伯克希尔的成功</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"berkshire-investments/key-investment-cases\">经典投资案例</a>（喜诗 1972 / 可口可乐 1988 / 苹果 2016）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 <a href=\"speeches-and-teachings/\">演讲与教诲</a></strong>——两篇分量最重、流传最广的讲演。<ul>\n<li><a href=\"speeches-and-teachings/the-psychology-speech\">误判心理学演讲</a>（1995 初讲，2005 修订）</li>\n<li><a href=\"speeches-and-teachings/the-usc-commencement\">南加大毕业演讲</a>（2007 年 5 月 13 日）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[&quot;南加大毕业演讲&lt;br/&gt;(门槛最低)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;这部书及其智慧&lt;br/&gt;(了解载体)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;十一篇讲演&lt;br/&gt;(总览地图)&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;伯克希尔的成功&lt;br/&gt;+ 经典投资案例&lt;br/&gt;(看原理落地)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;误判心理学演讲&lt;br/&gt;(最难,留到最后)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  A[\"南加大毕业演讲&lt;br/&gt;(门槛最低)\"] --&gt; B[\"这部书及其智慧&lt;br/&gt;(了解载体)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"十一篇讲演&lt;br/&gt;(总览地图)\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"伯克希尔的成功&lt;br/&gt;+ 经典投资案例&lt;br/&gt;(看原理落地)\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"误判心理学演讲&lt;br/&gt;(最难,留到最后)\"]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>先读</strong> <a href=\"speeches-and-teachings/the-usc-commencement\">南加大毕业演讲</a>——情感入口最低，迅速建立对芒格语气与价值观的整体感受。</li>\n<li><strong>再读</strong> <a href=\"poor-charlies-almanack/the-book-and-its-wisdom\">这部书及其智慧</a> 与 <a href=\"poor-charlies-almanack/the-eleven-talks\">十一篇讲演</a>——理解他全部作品的容器与地图。</li>\n<li><strong>然后看</strong> <a href=\"berkshire-investments/the-berkshire-success\">伯克希尔的成功</a> 与 <a href=\"berkshire-investments/key-investment-cases\">经典投资案例</a>——观察抽象原理如何在喜诗、可口可乐、苹果上严丝合缝地落地。</li>\n<li><strong>最后啃</strong> <a href=\"speeches-and-teachings/the-psychology-speech\">误判心理学演讲</a>——信息密度最高，具备前面框架后才好消化。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：本卷不要求金融背景，但若先浏览 <a href=\"../core-contributions/investment-principles/quality-over-cheapness\">核心贡献·投资原则</a> 中&quot;质量重于便宜&quot;的基本主张，再读第二章的投资案例会更顺畅。误判心理学若觉吃力，可先读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/psychology-of-misjudgment/twenty-five-biases\">思想方法·二十五种偏误</a> 打底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阅读时的提醒\">阅读时的提醒</h2><p>芒格本人最反对的，是把他的作品工具化为&quot;投资速成手册&quot;或&quot;励志金句库&quot;。本卷反复强调：他的代表成就之所以传世，靠的是<strong>底层的理性决策过程与心理纪律</strong>，而非可抄袭的持仓清单或可摘抄的金句。读这些作品，关注的应是&quot;他为什么这样想&quot;，而非&quot;他买了什么、说了哪句话&quot;。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poor-charlies-almanack","title":"穷查理宝典","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/poor-charlies-almanack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-book-and-its-wisdom","title":"《穷查理宝典》及其智慧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/poor-charlies-almanack/the-book-and-its-wisdom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-eleven-talks","title":"十一篇讲演","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/poor-charlies-almanack/the-eleven-talks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"berkshire-investments","title":"伯克希尔与投资成就","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/berkshire-investments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-berkshire-success","title":"伯克希尔的成功","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/berkshire-investments/the-berkshire-success"},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-investment-cases","title":"经典投资案例","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/berkshire-investments/key-investment-cases"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"speeches-and-teachings","title":"演讲与教诲","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/speeches-and-teachings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-psychology-speech","title":"误判心理学演讲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/speeches-and-teachings/the-psychology-speech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-usc-commencement","title":"南加大毕业演讲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/major-works/speeches-and-teachings/the-usc-commencement"}]}]}